WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.418 --> 00:00:03.385
Unit twenty. Digital Wellbeing!

2
00:00:04.312 --> 00:00:09.442
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.492 --> 00:00:12.468
