4
00:00:12.518 --> 00:00:16.813
Today we learn about Digital Wellbeing. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.086 --> 00:00:22.520
Digital wellbeing. Say it with me. Digital wellbeing!

6
00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:29.775
Screen time. Say it with me. Screen time!

7
00:00:33.295 --> 00:00:38.045
Notifications. Say it with me. Notifications!

8
00:00:41.537 --> 00:00:45.170
Sleep. Say it with me. Sleep!

9
00:00:48.645 --> 00:00:52.728
Focus. Say it with me. Focus!

10
00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:59.770
Breaks. Say it with me. Breaks!

11
00:01:03.269 --> 00:01:07.353
Offline. Say it with me. Offline!

12
00:01:10.846 --> 00:01:14.612
Balance. Say it with me. Balance!

13
00:01:18.097 --> 00:01:31.503
Digital wellbeing means using technology in a healthy way. Turning off notifications improves focus, and screen-free time before bed helps sleep. Regular breaks and offline time keep balance.

14
00:01:31.553 --> 00:01:34.961
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:35.768 --> 00:01:41.023
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:41.073 --> 00:01:42.481
Notifications!

17
00:01:43.677 --> 00:01:49.128
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.178 --> 00:01:50.328
Offline!

19
00:01:51.581 --> 00:01:57.015
Did you know? Turning off non-essential notifications can help you focus for longer!

20
00:01:57.065 --> 00:01:59.268
Wow! I did not know that!

21
